# API source of truth

- Implement only operations in the contrib hub pin
  `contract/openapi/merchants.openapi.yaml` (nested checkout:
  `contrib/contract/` from `mm_aggregator`) and `/api/v1/schema/merchants/`.
- Cross-check the live schema if the pin may be behind. Do not invent paths,
  headers, or error codes.
- Never put merchant API keys in frontend or plugin JavaScript.
